<title>HONG KONG: Seapower Int'l posts loss in interim.</title>
<headline>Seapower Int'l posts loss in interim.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 1.46 loss vs 3.72 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	2.84 loss vs 21.95 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  7.44 loss vs 17.21 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		   206.38    vs 198.08</p>
<p>    Company name	     Seapower International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Seapower International Holdings engages in property investment and development and securities broking. Exceptional represents loss on sale of leasehold properties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
